      "captions": [
        {
          "t0": 0,
          "t1": 0.86,
          "text": "Welcome to the labs!"
        },
        {
          "t0": 0.86,
          "t1": 5.42,
          "text": "Here, we don’t look at machines from far away: we take them apart."
        },
        {
          "t0": 5.42,
          "t1": 7.7,
          "text": "This is a wheel, seen at an angle."
        },
        {
          "t0": 7.7,
          "t1": 11.7,
          "text": "In a lab, you can walk around it, isolate a part, cut it open."
        },
        {
          "t0": 11.7,
          "t1": 15.74,
          "text": "Then everything comes undone, and every part has its own sheet: an overview,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 16.02,
          "t1": 18.62,
          "text": "its specifications, how to look after it."
        },
        {
          "t0": 18.62,
          "t1": 22.86,
          "text": "And once it is all back together, the machine runs again: a live simulation,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 22.86,
          "t1": 25.9,
          "text": "where you change the settings and read what comes out."
        },
        {
          "t0": 25.9,
          "t1": 27.2,
          "text": "Here are the labs."
        },
        {
          "t0": 27.2,
          "t1": 31.38,
          "text": "Each one is a site of its own, with its machine and its question."
        },
        {
          "t0": 31.38,
          "t1": 35.74,
          "text": "The filters sort them by field, and each card gives the level and the time."
        },
        {
          "t0": 35.74,
          "t1": 38.5,
          "text": "Open one, play, and come back here to pick the next."
        },
        {
          "t0": 38.5,
          "t1": 42.63,
          "text": "Inside every lab, you find the same bearings: views in three dimensions,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 42.9,
          "t1": 47.54,
          "text": "a sheet for every part, an assembly guide, a simulation, drawings, short lessons."
        },
        {
          "t0": 47.54,
          "t1": 48.98,
          "text": "And a voice like this one."
        },
        {
          "t0": 48.98,
          "t1": 51.42,
          "text": "A word of honesty, said just once."
        },
        {
          "t0": 51.42,
          "t1": 56.84,
          "text": "These labs are independent educational reconstructions: neither official drawings nor makers’ products."
        },
        {
          "t0": 56.84,
          "t1": 60.34,
          "text": "The sources are credited here, and inside every lab."
        },
        {
          "t0": 60.34,
          "t1": 62.7,
          "text": "This voice is a synthetic voice."
        },
        {
          "t0": 62.7,
          "t1": 66.99,
          "text": "And these labs are for understanding, not for building without care: electricity, water,"
        },
        {
          "t0": 67.12,
          "t1": 68.66,
          "text": "fire and gas have their rules."
        },
        {
          "t0": 68.66,
          "t1": 69.39,
          "text": "Over to you!"
        }
      ],
